 "<span style=\"display:inline-block;width:1.7em;height:1.7em;line-height:1.7em;border-radius:50%;background:#c98a1e;color:#fff;text-align:center;font-weight:800;margin-right:.7em\">3</span>La otra cámara lo vota también": "<span style=\"display:inline-block;width:1.7em;height:1.7em;line-height:1.7em;border-radius:50%;background:#c98a1e;color:#fff;text-align:center;font-weight:800;margin-right:.7em\">3</span>The other chamber votes on it too",
 "<span style=\"display:inline-block;width:1.7em;height:1.7em;line-height:1.7em;border-radius:50%;background:#6d4aa8;color:#fff;text-align:center;font-weight:800;margin-right:.7em\">4</span>El presidente lo firma o lo veta": "<span style=\"display:inline-block;width:1.7em;height:1.7em;line-height:1.7em;border-radius:50%;background:#6d4aa8;color:#fff;text-align:center;font-weight:800;margin-right:.7em\">4</span>The president signs it or vetoes it",
 "<span style=\"display:inline-block;width:1.7em;height:1.7em;line-height:1.7em;border-radius:50%;background:#c0455f;color:#fff;text-align:center;font-weight:800;margin-right:.7em\">5</span>Si hay veto, el Congreso puede anularlo con dos tercios": "<span style=\"display:inline-block;width:1.7em;height:1.7em;line-height:1.7em;border-radius:50%;background:#c0455f;color:#fff;text-align:center;font-weight:800;margin-right:.7em\">5</span>If there is a veto, Congress can override it with a two-thirds vote",
